: 2\nL290: \nL291: Your browser does not support audio playback.\nL292: \nL293: Your browser does not support audio playback.\nL294: ### Pretrain: In-Context Learning (ICL)\nL295: \nL296: We designed few-shot in-context learning evaluation tasks for MiMo-Audio to assess the model's ability to complete speech-to-speech generation tasks relying solely on contextual speech examples without parameter updates. This benchmark aims to systematically evaluate the model's comprehensive potential in speech understanding and generation—we expect to observe emergent in-context learning capabilities similar to those demonstrated by GPT-3 in the text domain.\nL297: Functions include: Style Conversion, Voice Conversion, Speech Translation, and Speech Editing.\nL298: \nL299: In-Context Learning Demo\nL300: \nL301: cite19†In-Context Learning Demo†www.youtube.com L302: \nL303: [Button: Style: Default→Whisper] [Button: Style: Happy→Sad] [Button: Voice Conversion] [Button: Translation: EN→ZH] [Button: Translation: ZH→EN] [Button: Edit: Tempo+Reverb] [Button: Edit: Tempo+Pitch] [Button: Edit: Denoise] [Button: Add Sound: Speech Effect 1] [Button: Add Sound: Speech Effect 2]\nL304: \nL305: Style Conversion: default2whisper\nL306: \nL307: Case\nL308: Reference Source\nL309: \nL310: Reference Target\nL311: \nL312: Source\nL313: \nL314: Output\nL315: \nL316: 1\nL317: \nL318: Your browser does not support audio playback.\nL319: \nL320: Your browser does not support audio playback.\nL321: \nL322: Your browser does not support audio playback.\nL323: \nL324: Your browser does not support audio playback.\nL325: \nL326: 2\nL327: \nL328: Your browser does not support audio playback.\nL329: \nL330: Your browser does not support audio playback.\nL331: \nL332: Your browser does not support audio playback.\nL333: \nL334: Your browser does not support audio playback.\nL335: \nL336: Style Conversion: happy2sad\nL337: \nL338: Case\nL339: \nL340: Reference Source\nL341: \nL342: Reference Target\nL343: 